---
source: crates/zaun/src/cli.rs
expression: cmd.render_help().to_string()
---
Check for a newer version of Zaun, or install it (asks github.com; only while "Check for updates" is on)

Usage: zaun update [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  check  Ask github.com for the newest release: exit 0 when up to date, 10 when a newer version is available
  apply  Download, verify and install the newest version (a tarball installed by you only; Zaun must be closed and no game running)
  on     Check for updates once a day (asks github.com; your IP address and the time are all it learns)
  off    Never check for updates
  help   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -v, --verbose...  Increase log verbosity (-v debug, -vv trace)
  -h, --help        Print help
